<section class="docs-section" aria-labelledby="a11y">
  <h2 id="a11y">Accessibility</h2>
  <ul class="docs-list">
    <li>The image has empty alt text because the title next to it names the work. The product page carries the full description.</li>
    <li>The link's ::after covers the card, so a click anywhere on it opens the product. The focus ring is drawn around the whole card.</li>
    <li>Sold works show the Sold badge and drop the price.</li>
  </ul>
</section>
